Description: Persistent key-value database with server and tools
 Redis is an in-memory data structure server supporting strings, hashes,
 lists, sets, streams, transactions, Pub/Sub, Lua scripting, replication,
 Sentinel, persistence, and clustering.
 .
 This package contains the Redis server, Sentinel, command-line client,
 benchmark, data-file checking tools, configuration, and systemd units.

Package: redis-dev
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development header for Redis module development
 This package contains the header required for building loadable Redis
 modules.
